WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
A recording can make a daily routine simpler. But can it prove a faster result?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The seller offers twelve levels, with four listening formats per level.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Research on meditation is not the same as a trial of this recording.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Before buying, ask about the final charge, refund procedure, and what outcomes were independently measured.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the evidence first. You can try a quiet twelve-minute pause for free.
